n1 cursor (phase-04:68–69), n2 8-case table (phase-02:63–65), n3 parity reworded (phase-02:67), n4 `gen_random_uuid()` (phase-01:43), n5 goroutine-safe (phase-03:54–55), n6 last-active warning (phase-04:70–71), n7 `disabled` wire-state (phase-03:48–50), n8 test axes (semantics pinned; concurrent-PUT explicit), n9 KEK-rotation scope note (phase-02:72). phase-01:44–45 also lands the P-051 `jsonb_typeof='array'` fail-closed CHECK.

